at may restrain a resident's ability to function.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0641":{"code":"F-0641","title":"Ensure each resident receives an accurate assessment.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0756":{"code":"F-0756","title":"Ensure a licensed pharmacist perform a monthly drug regimen review, including the medical chart, following irregularity reporting guidelines in developed policies and procedures.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0760":{"code":"F-0760","title":"Ensure that residents are free from significant medication errors.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0919":{"code":"F-0919","title":"Make sure that a working call system is available in each resident's  bathroom and bathing area.","category":"Environmental Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0732":{"code":"F-0732","title":"Post nurse staffing information every day.","category":"Nursing and Physician Services Deficiencies","concept":"staffing","concept_label":"Staffing & supervision"},"cms-f0580":{"code":"F-0580","title":"Immediately tell the resident, the resident's doctor, and a family member of situations (injury/decline/room, etc.)  that affect the resident.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-k0521":{"code":"K-0521","title":"Ensure heating and ventilation systems that have been properly installed according to the manufacturer's instructions.","category":"Services Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f05